flowchart TB
    subgraph Implemented[Implemented Python reference sequence]
        A[Caller provides a complete response]
        B[Serialize the entire response before yielding]
        C{At or above threshold?}
        D[Small path: AdaptiveResponseFilter returns full result; filter_response yields one concat envelope]
        E{Top-level JSON object?}
        F[Split object by top-level member; reject oversized member]
        G[Split fallback text by UTF-8 code-point boundaries]
        H[Create CRC32 envelopes with sequence, total, and merge mode]
        I[Return full result or yield envelopes to caller]
        J[One Reassembler validates and buffers the message]
        J1[Rule: total_chunks must stay stable for the message; duplicate identical frames are ignored; conflicting duplicates are rejected; UTF-8 code points are never split; unsplittable values fail explicitly]
        K{All chunks present?}
        L[Merge object fragments or concatenate bytes]
        M[Return complete result; no partial UI render]
    end

    subgraph Integration[Production integration described by article, not implemented]
        N[Transport adapter and gateway]
        O[Client protocol implementation]
        P[Optional progressive rendering after validated state]
    end

    A --> B --> C
    C -->|No| D --> I
    C -->|Yes| E
    E -->|Yes| F --> H
    E -->|No| G --> H
    F -. oversized element .-> Q[UnsplittableValueError]
    G -. code point larger than cap .-> Q
    H --> I --> J --> J1 --> K
    K -->|No| J
    K -->|Yes| L --> M
    I -. caller must add transport .-> N --> O --> P
